{"id":"claim:person/person-number-interactions--tura-affix-triggers-plural-verb-suffix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/person-number-interactions","topics":["topic:person/person-number-interactions","topic:person/person-number-interactions--plural-control"],"statement":{"en":"When tura takes a personal affix meaning 'with me', the accompanying main verb can be marked by a plural personal suffix as if the subject were plural.","ja":"turaが人称接辞をとって「私と一緒に」の意味を表す場合、主語が複数であるかのように主動詞は複数人称接尾辞によって表示されうる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"existential","modality":"possibility","conditions":["tura bears a personal affix"]},"forms":["tura","-as"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0027-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:person/person-number-interactions--plural-affix-verb-congruence","differs_in":"scope","note":"Statement 2 instantiates the general congruence principle of Statement 1 with a specific trigger (tura) and mechanism, at broader dialect scope"}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-27-47-372Z","status":"grouped"}
